      "text": "2. Setting Password (Optional)\n* Samsung shall not be liable for loss of user data caused by forgotten or stolen passwords. In an effort to keep the device as secure as possible, there is no password recovery option. If the password is forgotten, users need to have X5 to be restored to factory setting through online service rendered by our customer service centers. Please keep it in mind that all user data placed in X5 will be lost by factory reset.",
